  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "家計經濟學",
    "sub_ename": "HOUSEHOLD ECONOMICS",
    "describe_ch": "家計經濟學主要是介紹家計的經濟行為。授課內容包括：家計的基本模型、家計消費活動的分析，以及探討所得與價格對家計的影響、分析家計的儲蓄與借貸行為、分析家計的工作與休閒活動、探討增加人力資本存量的活動、探討家計的生育行為以及討論結婚與離婚的經濟學。",
    "describe_eh": "Household economics is an introduction of the economic behavior of the household. The topics includes the basic economic model of the household; the consumption activities of the household and how income and price change affect them; household's saving, borrowing, and lending activities; the household's work and leisure activities; the household's fertility behavior; that is, the demand for children; and the economics of marriage and divorce.",
